  "slug": "90-day-ai-implementation-plan",
  "title": "90-Day AI Implementation Plan for Indian Businesses",
  "h1": "The 90-Day AI Implementation Plan: Three Gates Every Business Must Clear",
  "description": "Most AI projects die in the first 30 days, and never because of the technology. A 90-day plan with three pass/fail gates: proof, system and handover.",
  "date": "2026-06-13",
  "tags": [
   "AI Implementation",
   "Roadmap",
   "MSME"
  ],
  "originalHeadline": "He Texted Me \"Sir, Paisa Waste Ho Gaya\" on Day 25. By Day 90 He Had Freed Up 30 Hours a Week. The Only Thing That Changed Was the Order He Did Things In.",
  "cover": "/blog/newsletter/tkh6c.jpg",
